      <p>Every month, a new "10 AI tools every student needs" listicle shows up. Most of them list the same five paid tools with a "use the free trial" footnote. So we did something different: we actually <strong>tested the free tiers</strong> of 22 popular AI tools on real student work for two full weeks. No paid upgrades. No credit card. No "free for the first 7 days then $20/month" tricks.</p>

      <p>This is what we found. The list is ranked by usefulness, not by brand recognition. If a popular tool had a useless free tier, we left it off. If an obscure tool genuinely helped with homework, it made the cut.</p>

      
